    <briefdescription>
<para>Promotes private symbols to global hidden, and renames to prevent clashes with other promoted symbols. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The same SymbolPromoter instance should be used for all symbols to be added to a single <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_j_i_t_dylib" kindref="compound">JITDylib</ref>. </para>
